Package: AttrMort
Type: Package
Title: Attributable Mortality from Air Pollution Exposure
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Yifan", family = "LIU", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yifan.liu@smail.nju.edu.cn",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7705-1987"))
Description: Estimates the health burden attributable to ambient air pollution
    exposure. Provides attributable mortality calculation with
    population-weighted concentration-response calibration, driving-factor
    decomposition and uncertainty analysis.
    Accepts data frames as well as CSV, Excel and gridded GeoTIFF inputs, and
    aligns heterogeneous spatial and tabular data automatically. Concentration-
    response functions include IER, GEMM, NCD+LRI, 5COD and MRBRT variants, plus
    ozone and nitrogen dioxide curves; user-supplied lookup tables are supported.
